.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Greatly increases reload speed"},{"name":"Light Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/736b486ddb80beefacb4f09b5ad016eb.png","desc":"Improved reload and range.\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases range"},{"name":"Accurized Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/d85024478504205359c7fb52dbc4f6b6.png","desc":"This weapon can fire longer distances.\n  •  Increases range"},{"name":"Tactical Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/f0e309a267b25279a871d182f8910bcc.png","desc":"This weapon has multiple tactical improvements.\n  •  Slightly increases stability\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Slightly increases magazine size"},{"name":"Drop Mag","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9d19f0c349652f0285bb5f999307b8a1.png","desc":"Increases reload speed but reduces magazine size."},{"name":"Steady Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6c6e1cc341487a8afd0b0c714a229255.png","desc":"This magazine is optimized for recoil control.\n  •  Greatly increases stability \n  •  Slightly decreases range\n  •  Increases airborne effectiveness"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Feeding Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/89d7e65f5ebe8d291ea96f128765921d.png","desc":"Each rapid kill with this weapon progressively increases reload speed for a short time."},{"name":"Demolitionist","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/da009697110e06b65d6f827b3b6d5f70.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate grenade energy. Activating your grenade ability reloads this weapon from reserves."},{"name":"Zen Moment","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9650a58cd3a439bf3b53a53dbc8122a0.png","desc":"Causing damage with this weapon reduces recoil and flinch over time."},{"name":"Keep Away","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/597cd0f1c5fe1f7681a1c129f8b958dd.png","desc":"Increases reload, range, and accuracy when no targets are in close proximity."},{"name":"Rewind Rounds","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a201fd61905b802867b677cf927e6e04.png","desc":"When this weapon's magazine is empty, it refills from reserves based on the number of hits."},{"name":"Reconstruction","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/9b0c09a784bc7af2f7d038e3626832a9.png","desc":"This weapon slowly reloads itself over time, up to double capacity."},{"name":"Supercharged Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b17b5725c96e59f838ae045b8433f8df.png","desc":"While amplified, ammo is gradually transferred from reserves to the magazine. \n\nWhile in Speed Booster, ammo regenerates faster and overflows the magazine."},{"name":"Jolting Feedback","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/27270b6f5da035b05fa797c82bb6a10d.png","desc":"Dealing repeated damage with this weapon inflicts Jolt. \n\nWhile amplified, Jolt is applied faster."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Elemental Capacitor","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e455d94dcafdab7a0d5a850712908020.png","desc":"Increased stats based on the currently equipped Super.\n• [Solar] increases your reload speed.\n• [Arc] increases handling.\n• [Void] increases stability.\n• [Stasis] moderately controls recoil and increases movement speed when aiming down sights.\n• [Strand] increases airborne effectiveness."},{"name":"Voltshot","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/a71ffb1cb221ea64fa77ab473f8a3a61.png","desc":"Reloading this weapon after defeating a target overcharges this weapon for a short period of time, causing it to jolt on its next hit."},{"name":"High Ground","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5ee6f65d7af0a9acf6f22e3254e85283.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant stacks of bonus damage. Attacking targets from higher ground immediately grants the maximum number of stacks."},